---
title: Horizontal List
description: Horizontal sortable list using sortable({ layout: 'horizontal' }) on DndDroppable.
---

# Horizontal List

Pass `strategy={sortable({ layout: 'horizontal' })}` to `DndDroppable` — previews are rendered automatically with the container's layout. The reorder logic is the same as the vertical example — only the layout changes.

